# Vendored third-party bundles. `wallpaper/` itself is gone, but its vendor step used
# to copy 24MB of MediaPipe binaries into the worktree, and a `git add -A` in a later
# commit swept them into the repo — 24MB that every clone then pays for, and nobody
# noticed until the pull output was read line by line. Ignored so the same accident
# cannot repeat if any vendoring script is ever run here again.
wallpaper/
**/src/vendor/
